  evidence: [github:dxos/dxos/packages/plugins/plugin-presenter/src/components/Slide/EmbeddedSurface.tsx#EmbeddedSurface]
  tests: [github:dxos/dxos/packages/plugins/plugin-presenter/src/components/MarkdownSlide/MarkdownSlide.test.tsx]
  note: |
    `EmbeddedSurface` resolves the `echo:` URI and mounts the object's Slide surface, and `MarkdownSlide.test.tsx`
    checks the embed markup. The embed grows to fill the slide below its text (`layouts.tsx`); no code lays it over
    the whole viewport.
```

